          {
            "title": "Inspect a Delivery Response",
            "id": 152325,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ein Liefer-Tracker benötigt den numerischen Status der Antwort. Vervollständige den Attributzugriff.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"status = response.status_code\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ok\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>status_code</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ein Liefer-Tracker benötigt den numerischen Status der Antwort. Vervollständige den Attributzugriff.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"status = response.status_code\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ok\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"json\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>status_code</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Check GET Success",
            "id": 152326,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Vervollständige die Bedingung, die eine erfolgreiche <code>GET</code>-Antwort erkennt.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" response.status_code == \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Success&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"404\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>200</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Akzeptiere bei einer <code>GET</code>-Antwort nur den standardmäßigen Erfolgsstatus.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" response.status_code == \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Success&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"404\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"500\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>==</code>, gefolgt von <code>200</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Recall Not Found",
            "id": 152327,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welcher Statuscode bedeutet, dass die angeforderte Ressource nicht gefunden wurde?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>404</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>200</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>500</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>404</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Du forderst eine gelöschte Reservierung an. Der Server funktioniert, findet sie aber nicht. Welcher Statuscode passt zu dieser Antwort?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>404</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>200</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>500</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>201</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>404</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Report a Server Error",
            "id": 152328,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Vervollständige den Zweig, der einen internen Serverfehler erkennt.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" response.status_code == \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Server error&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"404\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>500</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Vervollständige den Zweig, der einen internen Serverfehler erkennt.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" response.status_code == \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Server error&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ok\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"404\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>status_code</code>, gefolgt von <code>500</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Separate Error Branches",
            "id": 152329,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gib den Statuscode ein, mit dem überprüft wird, ob die Ressource nicht verfügbar ist.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" response.status_code == \" /><text value=\"404\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Not found&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" response.status_code == \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Server error&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"30\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>404</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Keep the New Booking",
            "id": 152330,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Eine Buchungs-API hat eine Reservierung mit dem Status <code>201</code> erstellt. Vervollständige die allgemeine Erfolgsprüfung.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" create_response.ok:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Created&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"is_success\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Traceback (most recent call last):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  File &quot;/home/code/file.py&quot;, line 1, in &lt;module&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    if create_response.ok:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"NameError: name 'create_response' is not defined\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>ok</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Deine Buchungs-API gibt <code>201</code> zurück. Verwende ihre allgemeine Erfolgseigenschaft, die bei Fehlerantworten false ist.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" create_response.ok:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Created&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"status_code\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"json\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>ok</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Choose the General Check",
            "id": 152331,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welche Bedingung akzeptiert sowohl <code>200</code> als auch <code>201</code>, lehnt aber <code>404</code> und <code>500</code> ab?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>response.ok</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.status_code == 200</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.status_code == 404</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>response.ok</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welche Bedingung akzeptiert sowohl <code>200</code> als auch <code>201</code>, lehnt aber <code>404</code> und <code>500</code> ab?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>response.ok</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.status_code == 200</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.status_code == 404</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.status_code &lt; 500</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>response.ok</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Check Before JSON",
            "id": 152332,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welche Zeile sollte vor <code>response.json()</code> ausgeführt werden, damit fehlgeschlagene HTTP-Antworten die normale Verarbeitung beenden?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>response.raise_for_status()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.status_code</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.ok</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>response.raise_for_status()</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Du liest <code>response.ok</code>, aber dein Code parst eine fehlgeschlagene Antwort trotzdem als JSON.</p><p>Welche Zeile vor <code>response.json()</code> löst einen HTTP-Fehler aus und beendet die normale Verarbeitung?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>response.raise_for_status()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.status_code</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.ok</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.json()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>response.raise_for_status()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Catch the HTTP Error",
            "id": 152333,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gib den Namen der Ausnahme ein, die Fehler vom Typ <code>HTTPError</code> abfängt, die von <code>raise_for_status()</code> ausgelöst werden.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests.exceptions.HTTPError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Request failed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"36\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"  File &quot;/home/code/file.py&quot;, line 1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    except requests.exceptions.HTTPError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    ^\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"SyntaxError: invalid syntax\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>HTTPError</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Review Response Tools",
            "id": 152334,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welches Paar liest zuerst den genauen Code und überprüft danach den allgemeinen Erfolg?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>response.status_code, response.ok</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.ok, response.json()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.json(), response.status_code</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>response.status_code, response.ok</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welches Paar liest zuerst den genauen Code und überprüft danach den allgemeinen Erfolg?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>response.status_code, response.ok</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.ok, response.json()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.json(), response.status_code</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.status_code, response.json()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>response.status_code, response.ok</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
